# First person, on desktop or in a Quest 3 headset: you walk: the developer's layout, as fixtures
world First person, on desktop or in a Quest 3 headset: you walk
  seed 1
  size 28
  terrain relief 0 roughness 0
  ground gravel weight 1
  ground flagstone weight 0.5
  fixture usu mortar (usu) size 0.84x0.7x0.84 material wood (heavy keyaki stump, bowl carved in the top) at 0,0
  fixture oke hand-water bucket size 0.4x0.26x0.4 material wood, filled with water at -0.95,0.35
  fixture seiro rice steamer stack size 0.62x0.71x0.62 material wooden steamer boxes over a pot of boiling water at 3.3,-1.4
  fixture kamado clay stove size 1.1x0.85x0.9 material clay at 3.3,-1.4
  fixture takibi bonfire size 1.1x1x1.1 material iron basket of burning split logs at -6.5,4.2
  fixture bonsho temple bell size 1.1x1.65x1.1 material bronze at -12,-5
  fixture turner turner size 1x1x1 material person, kneeling at -0.78,-0.08
  fixture shrine_hall shrine hall size 14.2x6.2x8.7 material wood and plaster on a stone platform at 0,-12
  fixture stall kohaku curtain stall size 11x2.6x0.1 material fabric curtain porous 1 at 0,-5.7
  fixture table mochi table size 1.9x0.78x0.8 material wood at -3.3,-1.5
  fixture shoro bell pavilion size 4.6x0.6x4.6 material stone base, open wooden posts porous 1 at -12,-5
  weather rain 0 wind 0.05 fog 0
  time 23:00 season winter temp -2

loop wood-fire-crackling-steady
    source_id stove_fire
    randomstart
    radius 0.8
    at kamado
    spl 54
    distance_model free_field_v1
    visual sphere

gen steamer_texture
    prompt steady steam escaping between wooden rice steamer boxes, continuous fine pressurized hiss with gentle irregular fluctuations, close dry recording, no whistle, no voices, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

loop steamer_texture
    source_id steamer_hiss
    randomstart
    radius 0.3
    at seiro
    spl 51
    distance_model free_field_v1
    visual sphere

gen boiling_pot_texture
    prompt water bubbling steadily in a cooking pot at a moderate rolling boil, rounded liquid bubbles breaking at the surface, close dry recording, no lid rattling, no voices, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

loop boiling_pot_texture
    source_id pot_bubbling
    randomstart
    radius 0.3
    at kamado
    spl 54
    distance_model free_field_v1
    visual sphere

gen bonfire_texture
    prompt split logs burning steadily in an open iron fire basket, lively wood crackles and irregular ember pops with steady flame combustion, close dry recording, no wind, no voices, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

loop bonfire_texture
    source_id bonfire
    randomstart
    radius 0.55
    at takibi
    spl 65
    distance_model free_field_v1
    visual sphere

# the world's soundscapes, decided before the sounds (keep these blocks; add each soundscape's own beds to its `sounds` line by source_id; beds that are the same everywhere go in the `kind world` block's `sounds` line)
soundscape shrine_courtyard
  label Shrine courtyard
  share snowy shrine courtyard with a rice-pounding stall
  kind open
  regions courtyard path station
  objects usu oke seiro kamado takibi bonsho pounder turner helper shrine_hall stall table shoro
  why One continuous open courtyard: walking along the path, into the mortar interaction area or toward the fires and open bell pavilion changes source balance gradually, with no supported acoustic jump.

soundscape everywhere
  kind world

on pound gen single heavy wooden mallet impact into wet glutinous rice in a solid wooden mortar, immediate weighty round wooden thud with grainy rice crushing and a sticky elastic slap, close dry recording, no leading silence, no voices
    source_id pound
    at usu
    spl 82
    pitch follow mochi_progress 0to1 1.06to0.9
    cooldown 0.06
    distance_model free_field_v1
    variants 4
    visual sphere

on turn gen single wet palm fold and flip of sticky rice dough onto itself, immediate rounded wet slap with a short dough squelch, close dry recording, no leading silence, no voices
    source_id turn
    at usu
    spl 72
    cooldown 0.08
    distance_model free_field_v1
    variants 3
    visual sphere

on dip gen single hand dipping into water in a small wooden bucket, immediate small splash followed by a few water droplets, close dry recording, no leading silence, no voices
    source_id dip
    at oke
    spl 60
    cooldown 0.1
    distance_model free_field_v1
    variants 3
    visual sphere

on steamer_open gen single wooden rice steamer box lifted from its stack, immediate light wooden separation knock and brief gust of escaping steam, close dry recording, no leading silence, no voices
    source_id steamer_open
    at seiro
    spl 63
    cooldown 0.2
    distance_model free_field_v1
    variants 3
    visual sphere

on rice_drop gen single two kilogram mass of freshly steamed sticky rice dropping onto wood, immediate heavy yielding wet plop with a short grainy settling tail, close dry recording, no leading silence, no voices
    source_id rice_drop
    at usu
    spl 70
    cooldown 0.15
    distance_model free_field_v1
    variants 3
    visual sphere

on bell_toll gen single large bronze Japanese bonsho temple bell struck by a wooden hanging log, immediate deep rounded bronze attack followed by a rich low beating hum decaying naturally for twenty seconds, close dry recording, no additional strikes, no voices
    source_id bell_toll
    at bonsho
    spl 89
    cooldown 0.5
    distance_model free_field_v1
    variants 3
    visual sphere

on step gen single boot footstep on snow-dusted {text}, immediate sole contact with granular snow compression and underlying surface contact, close dry recording, no leading silence
    source_id footsteps
    at player
    spl 64
    cooldown 0.13
    distance_model free_field_v1
    variants 6
    visual sphere
